## Usage Examples

### Example 1: Generate PVLib Baseline

```python
from src.inference.pvlib_predictor import PVLibPredictor

predictor = PVLibPredictor("data/metadata/germany/plant_03.json")

# Option 1: From weather forecast
weather_df = pd.read_parquet("data/processed/.../test.parquet")
pvlib_power = predictor.predict_from_weather(weather_df)

# Option 2: Clear-sky fallback
pvlib_power = predictor.predict_clear_sky("2023-11-01", num_steps=2880, freq="15min")
```

### Example 2: Upsample + Blend

```python
from src.inference.physics_glue import create_30day_forecast

forecast = create_30day_forecast(
    short_head_predictions=short_pred,  # (96,) @ 15-min
    long_head_hourly=long_pred,         # (720,) @ 1-hour
    pvlib_15min=pvlib_baseline,         # (2880,) @ 15-min
    alpha_day1=0.7,                     # Trust ML on Day 1
    alpha_days2_30=0.5,                 # Equal weight for Days 2-30
    constraints=True                    # Apply physics constraints
)
# Output: (2880,) @ 15-min
```

### Example 3: Complete Forecasting (when TFT inference implemented)

